---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/ui/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/ui/PageIntro.astro';
import { getBreadcrumbsForPath } from '../config/routes';
import { BUSINESS_PROFILE } from '../config/businessProfile';

const crumbs = getBreadcrumbsForPath('/disclaimer/');
const { regulatory, disclosures } = BUSINESS_PROFILE;
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Regulatory Disclaimers & Intermediary Disclosure — Ant Wealth Creation"
  description="Mandatory statutory disclosures, mutual fund risk statements, and intermediary status under SEBI and AMFI guidelines."
  currentPath="/disclaimer/"
>
  <div class="container page-container">
    <Breadcrumbs crumbs={crumbs} />

    <PageIntro
      eyebrow="Statutory Compliance"
      title="Regulatory Disclaimers & Disclosures"
      description="Transparent disclosure of our regulatory status, simulation boundaries, and mutual fund investment risk."
    />

    <div class="legal-card">
      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">1. Statutory Mutual Fund Risk Warning</h2>
        <div class="callout-box">
          <p class="highlighted-text">
            <strong>{disclosures.mutualFundRisk}</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
        <p>
          Investments in mutual funds are subject to market risks, including the possible loss of principal amount invested. Net Asset Value (NAV) of the schemes may go up or down depending upon the factors and forces affecting the securities market, including fluctuations in interest rates, government policies, liquidity conditions, and macroeconomic variables.
        </p>
        <p>
          Past performance of mutual funds, benchmark indices, or asset classes does not guarantee future results. Investors are advised to read Scheme Information Document (SID), Statement of Additional Information (SAI), and Key Information Memorandum (KIM) issued by the respective Asset Management Companies (AMCs) carefully before investing.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">2. Intermediary Status & Nature of Services</h2>
        <p>
          {disclosures.intermediaryStatement}
        </p>
        <p>
          {regulatory.soleProprietorStatement}
        </p>
        <p>
          {regulatory.sebiRIAStatusNotice}
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">3. Mutual Fund Distribution and Commission Disclosure</h2>
        <p>
          Ant Wealth Creation is an AMFI-registered mutual fund distributor (ARN 266896). When you invest through our distribution services in a Regular Plan, the relevant mutual fund AMC may pay us distributor remuneration, generally through trail commission. Commission amounts and rates may vary by AMC, scheme, plan, distribution arrangement and period and may change over time.
        </p>
        <p>
          We do not claim that AMFI prescribes one universal commission percentage band for all mutual-fund distributors and schemes. Material commission information, including commission received or receivable for competing schemes under consideration, must be disclosed in accordance with applicable requirements.
        </p>
        <p>
          Where exact current scheme-specific figures are not displayed on this page, investors can obtain the applicable figures by contacting us directly at <a href={`mailto:${BUSINESS_PROFILE.contact.email}`}>{BUSINESS_PROFILE.contact.email}</a> or by reviewing the respective AMC's statutory disclosures and Scheme Information Documents (SID). We do not invent commission percentages or AMC-specific links. Distributor commissions create a potential conflict of interest that investors should consider when comparing schemes.
        </p>
        <p>
          AMFI registration and public disclosure services do not mean that AMFI endorses Ant Wealth Creation or our recommendations. Official industry-wide commission information is available on the <a href="https://www.amfiindia.com/research-information/commission-disclosure" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">official AMFI commission-disclosure page</a>.
        </p>
        <p>
          The external portal link provided for existing clients (<a href={BUSINESS_PROFILE.contact.portfolioLoginUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">TheMFBox</a>) leads to a platform with login/signup functionality whose authenticated capabilities have not been independently verified by this website. A general disclaimer and an AMFI link do not, by themselves, establish compliance with any scheme-specific disclosure requirements for a platform offering an investment facility. For comprehensive details on distributor trail commissions, competing scheme disclosures, and Regular vs Direct Plan differences, please review our dedicated <a href="/commission-disclosure/">Commission Disclosure</a>.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">4. Illustrative Nature of Calculations & Financial Calculators</h2>
        <p>
          {disclosures.simulationDisclaimer}
        </p>
        <p>
          The financial calculators, milestone roadmaps, loan comparison tools, and goal projection utilities hosted on this website are designed purely as conceptual, educational decision-support frameworks. They rely on simplified mathematical assumptions (such as constant compounding rates, uniform inflation, and non-dynamic tax parameters) which do not mirror fluctuating real-world market conditions.
        </p>
        <p>
          No calculator output should be construed as financial advice, a formal financial plan, or an assurance of future returns.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">5. Tax & Statutory Framework Caveat</h2>
        <p>
          The Income-tax Act, 2025 came into force on 1 April 2026. The treatment of earlier tax years or pending matters may depend on applicable repeal-and-savings and transitional provisions. This website does not determine individual tax liability or provide personalised tax advice. Please consult a qualified tax professional for your circumstances. (Official reference: <a href="https://www.incometaxindia.gov.in/w/income-tax-act-2025-comes-into-force-from-1st-april-2026" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Income Tax Department Announcement</a>).
        </p>
        <p>
          Tax-related discussions and educational illustrations on this website are based on general interpretations of Indian income tax principles. Calculations do not model dynamic individual tax assessments. All calculators provide educational estimates and sensitivity analyses based on chosen inputs; they do not substitute for personalized financial planning or qualified tax counsel.
        </p>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">6. Development & Staging Notice</h2>
        <div class="prototype-notice-box">
          <p>
            <strong>{disclosures.prototypeNotice}</strong>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="legal-section">
        <h2 class="legal-heading">7. Related Policies & Inquiries</h2>
        <p>
          For additional details regarding website terms, user confidentiality, commissions, or to reach our team, please review our <a href="/commission-disclosure/">Commission Disclosure</a>, <a href="/privacy/">Privacy Policy</a>, <a href="/terms/">Terms of Use</a>, or visit our <a href="/contact/">Contact &amp; Grievance Redressal</a> page.
        </p>
      </section>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-container {
    padding-bottom: var(--space-16);
  }

  .legal-card {
    background-color: var(--color-bg-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: var(--space-8);
    box-shadow: var(--shadow-subtle);
    max-width: 860px;
  }

  @media (min-width: 768px) {
    .legal-card {
      padding: var(--space-12);
    }
  }

  .legal-section {
    margin-bottom: var(--space-10);
    padding-bottom: var(--space-8);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border-subtle);
  }

  .legal-section:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    padding-bottom: 0;
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .legal-heading {
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-family: var(--font-family-heading);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-brand-primary);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-section p {
    font-size: var(--text-body);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
  }

  .legal-section p:last-child {
    margin-bottom: 0;
  }

  .legal-section a {
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-section a:hover {
    color: var(--color-action-hover);
  }

  .legal-section a:focus-visible {
    outline: 2px solid var(--color-focus-ring);
    outline-offset: 2px;
  }

  .callout-box {
    background-color: var(--primitive-gold-50);
    border-left: 4px solid var(--color-brand-accent);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    margin-bottom: var(--space-4);
    border-radius: 0 var(--radius-md) var(--radius-md) 0;
  }

  .highlighted-text {
    color: var(--primitive-gold-700);
    margin: 0 !important;
  }

  .prototype-notice-box {
    background-color: var(--awc-mist);
    border: 1px dashed var(--awc-line);
    padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-6);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
  }

  .prototype-notice-box p {
    color: var(--color-text-brand);
    margin: 0;
    font-size: var(--text-body-sm);
  }
</style>
